rooms_desc ({"Dis room it be painted all black n yellow wit dese red stripesit be groovin wit a cool coconut smell an Cartel he be sittinin de corner peelin bananas and singin to 'imself...yeah he be in a weird mood tonight","Yes, my child, follow follow de coconut pathsoon, soon you too will be one wit de tropical groovesmell de water flowers taste de juice of de fruitde way to de shrine lies neardis be in de name of she who tastes like a ripe mango","***YES YES HEAR DE WORDS OF DE BROTHERS***Cartel shouts: yes yes praise, praise be to de tuppimonTuppence shouts: ack!Cartel shouts: hail de groovy one, mango shells and banana juice at de shrineTuppence shouts: cartel you little druggieBaer shouts: groove to the new guava goddess's tuneCartel shouts: yes me guava goddess your tropical will be doneBaer shouts: relax and partake in the mysteries of the tuppimon way of lifeCartel shouts: light de gourds and inhale its gaseous essenceBaer shouts: relax and partake in the mysteries of the tuppimon wayBaer says:  He Hehe Heheheheheheheh HEHEH!Tuppence shouts: oh boyBaer shouts: be at one with your soul, do the tuppimon rollBaer shouts: embrace it in wholeBaer shouts: it's all happenin' at the coconut shrineCartel shouts: Remove de sandales and revel wit de TuppimonFuzzy grins while sippin' de guava juice.","De guava queen brings peace to de non-believers of the tuppimonFuzzy shouts: Breathe the tuppimon in through de soul. de guava essence bringsFuzzy shouts: inner soul to de surfaceCartel shouts: yes yes feel de groove of de tuppimon spiritFuzzy shouts: leave de worry behind and live in de coconut shrineListen to de sounds of de groove","****FEEL DE SPIRIT********LET IT FILL DE SOUL********CAST OFF DE WORRIES AND DROWN DEM IN COCONUT MILK********FLOOD DE MIND WITH DE GUAVA JUICE********SUCH IS DE TUPPIMON WAY OF LIFE********PEACE AND MANGO RINDS BE WITH YOU**** hail hail","You be in de Coconut Shrine, take em off de sandales and unwindIt be an open breeze tent made o palm leaves and bananapeels wit dem water lilies lining de path to de shrinemade o half eaten mango rinds.  Relax, feel de groove andpraise be to de Groovy One, de Guava Goddess Tuppimon...","Here 'neath de coconut trees is where Cartel sat by de mighty riveron a palm leaf mat and learned of de Tuppimon way...How in de name of de Groovy One did he venture to dream upde Tuppimon?  It be known to none, but he be drunk on de juiceof life and de mind plays de tricks in de coconut grove.  Be derock hard mango dat hit his head or de peels on which he lay,dis Tuppimon dream will be de only way.Long live de Tuppimon, Hail de Guava Goddess","De Banana Hut...YES!  De truth, it has been revealed.De hut in which you groove is de hut of Tuppimon.De birds dey drink dere guava and sing de songs of de Wayas de Mighty River runneth bellow de stilts of de hut.De Sacred Guava it is perched neath de palm leaf mango roof.Here on de water lily mats sit de Banana Tribe of de Groovy One.El Cartello de Keeper of de Coconut Shrine (well janitor actually)De Icehouse Mon whose footsteps follow de Tuppimon wayDe Fuzzimon de sipper of de Guava juice and wearer of de Togaand Boadicea de Bearer of de Holy Fruit, de Juicemaker from which de Guava juice is gathered, you be de Palm tree from which de Coconut is picked, you be de cloth from which de Toga is spunBy de Guava Goddess, taste de Mango",0,0,})
